## API wiring

- Newsletter signup: `POST /api/newsletter/subscribe` on this site → **Resend Contacts** (resend.com dashboard → Contacts). Not the PWA `/cms` contact list unless synced separately.
- App login link: `POST /api/auth/request` on PWA — works
- GLP-1 news feed: `GET /api/glp1-feed` on PWA — used by landing build

## CMS (PWA — same repo, same deploy)

