|------|---------|
| `/cms/newsletter/login` | CMS login |
| `/cms` | Contacts |
| `/cms/emails/weekly` | Weekly newsletter compose |
| `/cms/emails/one-to-one` | 1:1 email |
| `/admin` | Whitelist |

PWA docs: `NEWSLETTER.md`, `STATE.md`, `chat-automator/`. Open **PWA-signal-plus-v2** in Cursor — not the retired admin repo.

## Cloud agent access

- Public repos (e.g. this landing repo): agent can push directly.
- Private repos (`PWA-signal-plus-v2`, `operatingmanual`): open a Cloud Agent task from that repo or grant the Cursor GitHub App access to it.
